<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <meta name="color-scheme" content="light dark">
  <meta name="supported-color-schemes" content="light dark">
  <title>Your Business is Live on Bloom</title>
</head>
<body style="margin: 0; padding: 0; background-color: #0f0f0f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;">

  <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="background-color: #0f0f0f;">
    <tr>
      <td align="center" style="padding: 40px 16px;">

        <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="max-width: 480px;">

          <!-- Header Image -->
          <tr>
            <td style="padding: 0; text-align: center;">
              <img src="https://trybloomapp.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/assets/welcome_header.png" alt="Bloom" width="480" style="display: block; width: 100%; max-width: 480px; height: auto; border-radius: 16px 16px 0 0;" />
            </td>
          </tr>

          <!-- Body -->
          <tr>
            <td style="background: #1a1a1a; border-left: 1px solid #2a2a2a; border-right: 1px solid #2a2a2a; padding: 48px 40px 0;">

              <!-- Business Logo -->
              <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="margin-bottom: 32px;">
                <tr>
                  <td align="left">
                    <img src="{{logo}}" alt="{{name}}" width="64" height="64" style="display: block; width: 64px; height: 64px; border-radius: 14px; object-fit: cover; border: 1px solid #2a2a2a;" />
                  </td>
                </tr>
              </table>

              <!-- Heading -->
              <p style="margin: 0 0 6px; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 2px; color: #DB1D6A;">
                Business Created
              </p>
              <p style="margin: 0 0 20px; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 400; color: #ffffff; line-height: 1.35; letter-spacing: -0.3px;">
                {{name}} is ready to go &#x1F389;
              </p>
              <p style="margin: 0 0 32px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.85; color: #888888;">
                Your business has been successfully set up on Bloom. You're now on the free plan with a starting balance of 2,000 credits enough to connect your first channel, deploy your bot, and start driving real conversations.
              </p>
            </td>
          </tr>

          <!-- Divider -->
          <tr>
            <td style="background: #1a1a1a; border-left: 1px solid #2a2a2a; border-right: 1px solid #2a2a2a; padding: 0 40px;">
              <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">
                <tr>
                  <td style="border-top: 1px solid #222222; font-size: 0; line-height: 0;">&nbsp;</td>
                </tr>
              </table>
            </td>
          </tr>

          <!-- What's included -->
          <tr>
            <td style="background: #1a1a1a; border-left: 1px solid #2a2a2a; border-right: 1px solid #2a2a2a; padding: 32px 40px 0;">
              <p style="margin: 0 0 24px; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 2px; color: #444444;">
                &#x2728; Your free plan includes
              </p>

              <!-- Item 1 -->
              <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="margin-bottom: 24px;">
                <tr>
                  <td width="40" valign="top">
                    <table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">
                      <tr>
                        <td style="width: 32px; height: 32px; background: #1f1f1f; border: 1px solid #2a2a2a; border-radius: 8px; text-align: center; line-height: 32px;">
                          <img src="https://trybloomapp.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/assets/icon-bot.png" width="16" height="16" alt="" style="display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle;" />
                        </td>
                      </tr>
                    </table>
                  </td>
                  <td style="padding-left: 14px;">
                    <p style="margin: 0 0 3px; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #e0e0e0; letter-spacing: -0.1px;">1 AI Bot</p>
                    <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 12px; color: #555555; line-height: 1.7;">Deploy one AI-powered bot to handle your customer conversations automatically.</p>
                  </td>
                </tr>
              </table>

              <!-- Item 2 -->
              <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="margin-bottom: 24px;">
                <tr>
                  <td width="40" valign="top">
                    <table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">
                      <tr>
                        <td style="width: 32px; height: 32px; background: #1f1f1f; border: 1px solid #2a2a2a; border-radius: 8px; text-align: center; line-height: 32px;">
                          <img src="https://trybloomapp.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/assets/icon-credits.png" width="16" height="16" alt="" style="display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle;" />
                        </td>
                      </tr>
                    </table>
                  </td>
                  <td style="padding-left: 14px;">
                    <p style="margin: 0 0 3px; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #e0e0e0; letter-spacing: -0.1px;">2,000 Credits</p>
                    <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 12px; color: #555555; line-height: 1.7;">Every bot response consumes credits. Upgrade your plan anytime for more.</p>
                  </td>
                </tr>
              </table>

              <!-- Item 3 -->
              <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="margin-bottom: 8px;">
                <tr>
                  <td width="40" valign="top">
                    <table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">
                      <tr>
                        <td style="width: 32px; height: 32px; background: #1f1f1f; border: 1px solid #2a2a2a; border-radius: 8px; text-align: center; line-height: 32px;">
                          <img src="https://trybloomapp.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/assets/icon-whatsapp.png" width="16" height="16" alt="" style="display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle;" />
                        </td>
                      </tr>
                    </table>
                  </td>
                  <td style="padding-left: 14px;">
                    <p style="margin: 0 0 3px; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #e0e0e0; letter-spacing: -0.1px;">WhatsApp Channel</p>
                    <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 12px; color: #555555; line-height: 1.7;">Connect WhatsApp and engage customers on the channel they use most.</p>
                  </td>
                </tr>
              </table>
            </td>
          </tr>

          <!-- CTA -->
          <tr>
            <td style="background: #1a1a1a; border-left: 1px solid #2a2a2a; border-right: 1px solid #2a2a2a; padding: 36px 40px 0;">
              <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">
                <tr>
                  <td style="border-top: 1px solid #222222; padding: 32px 0 0; text-align: center;">
                    <table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" align="center">
                      <tr>
                        <td style="background-color: #DB1D6A; border-radius: 10px; padding: 15px 40px;">
                          <a href="{{dashboardUrl}}" style="font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none; display: inline-block; letter-spacing: 0.2px;">
                            Open Dashboard &rarr;
                          </a>
                        </td>
                      </tr>
                    </table>
                    <p style="margin: 16px 0 0; font-size: 12px; color: #333333;">
                      Or copy this link: <span style="color: #555555;">{{dashboardUrl}}</span>
                    </p>
                  </td>
                </tr>
              </table>
            </td>
          </tr>

          <!-- Closing -->
          <tr>
            <td style="background: #1a1a1a; border: 1px solid #2a2a2a; border-top: none; border-radius: 0 0 16px 16px; padding: 32px 40px 40px;">
              <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.8; color: #666666;">
                If you have any questions or run into anything, just reply to this email. We read every message.
              </p>
              <p style="margin: 24px 0 0; font-size: 13px; color: #444444; line-height: 1.6;">
                Regards,<br />
                <span style="color: #DB1D6A; font-weight: 600;">The Bloom Team</span>
              </p>
            </td>
          </tr>

          <!-- Footer -->
          <tr>
            <td style="padding: 32px 40px; text-align: center;">
              <p style="margin: 0 0 6px; font-size: 11px; color: #333333;">
                &copy; 2026 Bloom &middot; All rights reserved
              </p>
              <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 11px; color: #2a2a2a;">
                You received this email because a business was created under your Bloom account.
              </p>
            </td>
          </tr>

        </table>
      </td>
    </tr>
  </table>

</body>
</html>
